(66, 0, '221220103921-muhamad-thoriq-aziz', 'Muhamad Thoriq Aziz', 'Thoriq', 'Bogor', '2001-03-09', 'thoriqcity@gmail.com', '085643724458', '1', '1', 'Kost Baru Pak Prayit RT 004 RW 034 Dusun Penen, Kec. Ngaglik, Kab. Sleman, D.I. Yogyakarta,Â 55285', '5', 'SMK Metland', '65', 'Multimedia', '2016', '2019', 'Mindreach Consulting', 'Image Editor', 'Jakarta', 'April 2022', 'July 2022', '4', '3.000.000 - 5.000.000', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\n\r\nThe creativity and enthusiasm of RNB have sparked my enthusiasm to become your next Graphic Designer. My ambitious interest in design with working at your company would be a unique and enriching experience for both parties.\r\n\r\nIn my position as an Image Editor for Mindreach Consulting, I edited images, such as clipping paths, removing background, retouching, etc. In addition to the full-time and internship experience, I also have experience participating in workshops or competitions. This experience helped me grow. I am also a very skilled person which allows me to join and blend into a group or team culture and continuously strive to achieve a common goal.\r\n\r\nMy resume is attached. Please let me know if I can give you more information about my background and qualifications. I look forward to hearing from you, thank you for your consideration.\r\n\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nMuhamad Thoriq Aziz', 'https://www.instagram.com/9galeri/', '221220103921_muhamad-thoriq-aziz_XG9Rm_GD Resume.pdf', '221220103921_muhamad-thoriq-aziz_XG9Rm_Samping - BW.jpg', '1||2||3||4||5', '2022-12-20 10:39:21'),
