(207, 0, '230215140338-endy-armand', 'Endy Armand', 'Endy', 'Pematang Siantar', '1978-10-19', 'endyarmand1978@gmail.com', '082241401185', '1', '2', 'Suryoputran KT II / 288, Yogyakarta', '5', 'SMA BOPKRI 2 YOGYAKARTA', '70', 'Sosial', '1993', '1996', 'Carnival Cruise Line||Rumah Pribadi ||Hotel TENTREM Yogyakarta', 'Stateroom Steward||Driver pribadi adik Pakualam X||Casual on call', 'Miami, Florida||Pakualaman, Yogyakarta||Yogyakarta', '11 September 2008||January 2019||June 2021', '11 August 2018||March 2021||September 2022', '', '2.600.000,-', '\r\n\r\nYogyakarta, February 13th, 2023\r\n\r\n\r\nAttention to :\r\nHead of HRD RnB Management\r\nYogyakarta\r\n                   \r\n \r\nDear Sir or Madam,\r\n \r\nBased on the advertising on social media , about the job as DRIVER in your company, I interested to join with your team. With this letter I would like to apply for a job as DRIVER. \r\n \r\nI have more than 9 years of experience as an Assistant Stateroom Steward with Carnival Cruise Line, a largest cruise ship company in USA. I have excellent driving skill, know about maintainence of the car and i have driving license. I can communicate in English fluently, both written and orally. I am used to contacting with guests, working in teams and working under pressure. Now, i am working on Housekeeping Departement, as Casual on Call at Hotel Tentrem Yogyakarta.\r\n \r\nI am looking for to expand my experience and get better career with ASIAN TRAILS, and hoping that I have enough qualifications to get the job. For your consideration, I have enclosed my Curriculum Vitae :\r\n \r\nName                                    : Endy Armand\r\nPlace / DOB                         : Pematang Siantar / October 19th 1978\r\nAddress                                : Suryoputran KT II / 288, Yogyakarta 55131\r\neMail                                     : endyarmand1978@gmail.com\r\nMarital Status                     : Married\r\nVaccination Status             : Vaccined by Aztrazeneca ( Batch 1 & 2 )\r\nContact  number                : 0822 4140 1185 ( WA) / 0858 6945 6603 ( CP)\r\n \r\nI look forward to hearing from you soon and I hope, I can explain myself and my potential more in an interview.\r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nSincerely,\r\n \r\nENDY ARMAND', '', '230215140338_endy-armand_O7rAP_general attch (1).pdf', '230215140338_endy-armand_O7rAP_pas foto.jpg', '1||2||3||4||5', '2023-02-15 14:03:38'),
