(512, 0, '231117150159-rima-novela', 'Rima Novela', 'Rima', 'Tangerang', '1999-11-04', 'rymanov23@gmail.com', '081327532835', '2', '1', 'Karangrejo, Magetan, Jawa Timur', '3', 'Universitas Airlangga', '3.26', 'Matematika', '2019', '2023', 'PT. Airlangga Bangun Persada||Develop Indonesia||Semicolon Academy||Grace Digital Printing', 'Marketing Designer||Intern Social Media||Marketing Exxecutive||Senior Designer', 'Surabaya||Surabaya||Surabaya||Magetan', '2023-01||2021-01||2022-07||2019-01', '2023-11||2021-03||2023-06||2019-06', '7', '3500000', 'I am a graduate of Mathematics at Airlangga University. I have a strong interest career in creative digital. To support this, I have some experiences in organizations, startups, and companies as media and creative division specially as a graphic designer staff for about 4 years when I was in college. I have strong creativity, detail-oriented, and have good understanding  about editing, design, photograpy, and videography.', 's.id/portofoliorima', '231117150159_rima-novela_JaSJR_CV GRAPHIC DESIGNER.pdf', '231117150159_rima-novela_JaSJR_20231106_164833_0000.png', '1||2||3||4||5', '2023-11-17 15:01:59'),
(513, 0, '231117165833-arafah-zakiyah-rachma', 'Arafah Zakiyah Rachma', 'Arafah', 'Bontang', '2000-10-06', 'arafahzr.00@gmail.com', '081344105979', '2', '1', 'Jl. Gn.Rinjani Hop  2/120 Komp. PT. Badak, Bontang, Kalimantan Timur', '3', 'Institut Kesenian Jakarta', '3,59', 'Desain Komunikasi Visual (DKV)', '2018', '2022', 'Kementrian Sosial RI||Kementrian Pariwisata dan Ekonomi Kreatif', 'Magang (Pejuang Muda)||Desainer Grafis (By Project)', 'DKI Jakarta||DKI Jakarta', '2021-10||2021-10', '2021-12||2021-11', '7', '3.000000', 'Saya merupakan lulusan S1 Desain Komunikasi Visual Institut Kesenian Jakarta yang lulus dengan IPK 3.59. Dengan latar belakang tersebut, Saya sudah familiar dan mahir dengan beberapa software, diantaranya adalah adobe photoshop, adobe illustrator, adobe indesign, serta basic adobe premiere pro. Memiliki ketertarikan dan kemauan belajar yang tinggi dalam desain grafis serta merupakan pribadi yang teliti, mampu bekerja dengan deadline, serta dapat bekerja dengan tim maupun secara individu.', 'https://www.behance.net/gallery/175387043/Arafahs-Portfolio-CV', '231117165833_arafah-zakiyah-rachma_w14Ee_CV-Arafah Zakiyah Rachma.pdf', '231117165833_arafah-zakiyah-rachma_w14Ee_Pasfoto Arafah.jpg', '1||2||3||4||5', '2023-11-17 16:58:33'),
