(804, 0, '250123193449-deandra-rizky-aditya', 'Deandra Rizky Aditya', 'Deandra', 'Jakarta', '1999-02-06', 'deandrizky@gmail.com', '081919060299', '1', '1', 'Cibubur Residence Blok C3 No. 7, Jatisampurna, Bekasi', '3', 'Universitas Brawijaya', '3.26', 'Ilmu Ekonomi', '2017', '2021', 'PT Medika Inovasi Indonesia||PT Mitra Rekayasa Keberlanjutan', 'Finance & Admin Staff||Branding & Venture Officer', 'Bekasi, Jawa Barat||Jakarta Selatan, DKI Jakarta', '2024-08||2023-02', '2024-12||2024-04', '5', '5000000', 'A 2 years experience in social media field with high enthusiast in researching content and creating unique content. Also a data-driven person who execute anything based on data. ', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Rtk8d6f9TakGfFegYVAiwzyRHTTJsm_d/view?usp=drivesdk', '250123193449_deandra-rizky-aditya_wKjKQ_Deandra Rizky A. - CV.pdf', '250123193449_deandra-rizky-aditya_wKjKQ_pas foto deandra.jpg', '1||2||3||4||5', '2025-01-23 19:34:49'),
