(899, 0, '260410131706-caesario-sectio-adi-pamungkas', 'Caesario Sectio Adi Pamungkas', 'Caesar', 'Ngawi', '2003-04-14', 'cscaesar123@gmail.com', '0895423861100', '1', '2', 'Perumahan Nawa Village, Kav. D-10, RT 02, Sambikerep, Bangunjiwo, Kasihan, Kab. Bantul, DIY 55184, Indonesia', '2', 'Amikom Yogyakarta', '3.65', 'Teknik Informatika', '2022', '2025', 'Suitmedia Digital Agency||Manggala Teknologi Nusantara', 'Graphic Designer Intern||Motion Graphic Designer', 'Jl. Pekayon 1 No.26, Ragunan, Ps. Minggu, Kota Jakarta Selatan, Daerah Khusus Ibukota Jakarta 12540||Jl Raya Papar - Pare , No 469, RT/RW 001, 004, Tegowangi, Kec. Plemahan, Kabupaten Kediri, Jawa Timur 64155', '2026-09||2025-11', '2026-12||2026-05', '1', '2650000', 'A recent Diploma (D3) graduate in Informatics Engineering from Universitas AMIKOM Yogyakarta, specializing in Graphic\r\nDesign, 2D/Motion Graphics, Video Editing, 3D Modeling, Illustration, and UI Design for websites/applications. I have\r\npractical experience as a Motion Graphic Designer at Manggala Teknologi Nusantara, where I spearheaded the end-to-end production of 7 comprehensive motion graphic videos for the TiketPendakian application. Additionally, I have 4\r\nmonths of practical experience as a Graphic Designer Intern at PT Suitmedia Kreasi Indonesia, a leading digital consulting\r\nagency. During my internship, I contributed to diverse projects for renowned clients such as Gopay, BTN, Madu Alshifa,\r\nInfomedia, Wincos, Nindya Karya, CTBC, SIER, and Solubis. My responsibilities included creating motion graphics, video\r\nediting, designing UI for web and applications, branding, and illustration. I am proficient in various creative software\r\nincluding Adobe After Effects, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop, Figma, Blender, Premiere Pro, Toon Boom Harmony,\r\nand Clip Studio Paint, as showcased in my portfolio at bit.ly/PortfolioCaesarPDF.\r\n', 'https://bit.ly/PortfolioCaesarPDF', '260410131706_caesario-sectio-adi-pamungkas_dannF_CV_Caesario Sectio Adi Pamungkas.pdf', '260410131706_caesario-sectio-adi-pamungkas_dannF_CaesarioSectioAdiPamungka.jpeg', '1||2||3||4||5', '2026-04-10 13:17:06'),
